    "udt_union_v0": {
      "doc": "Discriminated payload the off-chain Vectrs put inside the signed\\nenvelope. The warpdrive node's submission manager always invokes\\n`verify_xlm` on the handler \\xe2\\x80\\x94 there is no per-round entrypoint to\\nroute on \\xe2\\x80\\x94 so we wrap each round's struct in a tagged enum and\\ndispatch on the variant inside the handler.",
