  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "`StellarHandlerInterface::verify_xlm` \\xe2\\x80\\x94 the single entry the\\nwarpdrive node's submission manager invokes for every\\naggregated submission against this handler. The envelope payload\\nis a tagged `SubmissionPayload` whose variant decides whether\\nthis is a Round 2 single-Vectr attestation or a Round 3\\nquorum-signed final.\\n\\nBoth variants go through the same `try_verify` call (the\\nquorum is global to the security contract; with a single\\noperator at 1/1, one sig satisfies it; with N at 4/5, Round 2\\npayloads need their `event_id_salt` to be unique per Vectr so\\nthe host doesn't try to quorum-collapse different-value\\nattestations).",
      "name": "verify_xlm",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "envelope_bytes",
          "type_": "bytes"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "sig_data",
          "type_": {
            "udt": {
              "name": "Ed25519SignatureData"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "result": {
            "ok_type": "void",
            "error_type": {
              "udt": {
                "name": "OracleError"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "User-facing entry: ask the Vectr swarm for a TWAP on `asset` over\\n`range_secs`. Returns the request id (clients store it to poll\\nfor the final result via `final_twap(id)`).",
